{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink doorbell feels like a useful next step because it connects my recent Alexa purchases with my earlier door alarm purchase and adds entrance alerts and two-way communication.",
    "The larger Echo display and Dot with a clock fit my Alexa setup and offer understandable benefits, even though I would postpone them after buying similar devices recently."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "An older Echo Dot and another Fire TV Stick offer little value right now because my recent fourth-generation Dot and Fire TV Stick 4K Max already cover those needs.",
    "Internal drives do not follow naturally from my external drive and card-reader purchases because I have no internal upgrade project planned; the 512GB card also lacks a clear current use.",
    "A multi-camera bundle is more than I want to start with; a single doorbell addresses my entrance-monitoring interest more directly."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Alexa purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to recommend more Alexa devices, without enough attention to whether they add something useful or repeat a recent purchase.",
    "My storage purchases seem to have been treated as interest in any storage product, although external access, internal installation, and card capacity serve different needs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Show 5, its stand, Dot, and Fire TV bundle make another similar device less urgent, even when it fits my interests.",
    "I would start home monitoring with a practical entrance device before committing to several cameras.",
    "Compatibility and a specific task matter to me: owning a card reader does not establish a need for a large memory card or an internal drive."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my Alexa and practical electronics interests but missed how recent purchases and specific unmet needs determine what I would choose next."
}"}
